/AGENTS.md
/CONTEXT.md
/docs/
/research/
/experiments/

# Credentials and runtime output must stay local, including custom data roots.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/auth.json
**/credentials.json
**/deepseek-api-key.txt
**/model-runs/
**/raw/
**/human-notes/
**/connection-runtime/
**/reading-builds/

